NOTE: the lengths of the 0.625" o.d. sections have
been reduced by the lengths of the 2.310" o.d.
sections to simulate mounting plates, which are 
4" x 4" x 0.250" aluminum plates. These medium-duty
elements will withstand 96 mph winds.

This design was optimized for F/R over band > 20 dB,
and SWR over the band < 2:1, with a mid-band free-
space gain of 12.5 dBi.
